Um, this is the preview 
for the next episode of

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:54.610
"The Iceblade Sorcerer 
Shall Rule the World".

00:23:55.040 --> 00:23:57.170
While Ray is living 
the peaceful academy life,

00:23:57.170 --> 00:24:00.250
a ferocious blade hounds him 
relentlessly and won't let up!

00:24:00.250 --> 00:24:01.780
A duel begins!

00:24:01.780 --> 00:24:06.390
"The Boy Who Became the World's Strongest 
